==Description==
'''v1.6.2''' is the forty-eighth update to be released on Tower Defense Simulator, on the 14th of February 2023. 

This update was also given the name '''Valentines 2023 Update''', as it added the [[Lovely Crate]].

This version encompassed two updates, the main v1.6.2 update (released 14 February 2023) and the minor v1.6.2a update (released 15 February 2023).

==Additions==
===Crates===
*[[Lovely Crate]]
**Skins:
***[[Accelerator]]: {{Color|Lovely|Cupid}}
***[[Commander]]: {{Color|Lovely|Valentines}}
***[[Cowboy]]: {{Color|Lovely|Valentines}}
***[[Crook Boss]]: {{Color|Lovely|Cupid}}
***[[Engineer]]: {{Color|Lovely|Heartbreak}}
***[[Militant]]: {{Color|Lovely|Chocolatier}}
***[[Scout]]: {{Color|Lovely|Valentines}}
***[[Sniper]]: {{Color|Lovely|Valentines}}
***[[Soldier]]: {{Color|Lovely|Valentines}}
*[[Cold Front Crate]]
**Skins:
***[[Accelerator]]: {{Color|ColdFront|Ice Witch}}
***[[Commander]]: {{Color|ColdFront|Brisk}}
***[[Medic]]: {{Color|ColdFront|Stranded}}
***[[Sledger]]: {{Color|ColdFront|Brave Soul}}
***[[Scout]]: {{Color|ColdFront|Frost Hunter}}
***[[Sniper]]: {{Color|ColdFront|Silent}}

==Changes & Bugfixes==
*Seven skins moved from the [[Valentines Crate]] to the [[Lovely Crate]].
**Skins:
**:[[Sniper]]: {{Color|Lovely|Valentines}}
**:[[Scout]]: {{Color|Lovely|Valentines}}
**:[[Soldier]]: {{Color|Lovely|Valentines}}
**:[[Militant]]: {{Color|Lovely|Chocolatier}}
**:[[Crook Boss]]: {{Color|Lovely|Cupid}}
**:[[Cowboy]]: {{Color|Lovely|Valentines}}
**:[[Accelerator]]: {{Color|Lovely|Cupid}}
*Skin rarities of the skins that were moved from the [[Valentines Crate]] to the [[Lovely Crate]] changed.
**{{Color|Lovely|Valentines}} [[Sniper]] skin rarity changed from {{Color|Event}} to {{Color|Common}}.
**{{Color|Lovely|Valentines}} [[Soldier]] and [[Golden Soldier]] skin rarity changed from {{Color|Event}} to {{Color|Common}}.
**{{Color|Lovely|Chocolatier}} [[Militant]] skin rarity changed from {{Color|Event}} to {{Color|Uncommon}}.
**{{Color|Lovely|Cupid}} [[Crook Boss]] and [[Golden Crook Boss]] skin rarity changed from {{Color|Event}} to {{Color|Legendary}}.
**{{Color|Lovely|Valentines}} [[Cowboy]] and [[Golden Cowboy]] skin rarity changed from {{Color|Event}} to {{Color|Rare}}.
**{{Color|Lovely|Cupid}} [[Accelerator]] skin rarity changed from {{Color|Event}} to {{Color|Legendary}}.
*Slightly changed the lobby.
*[[Cold Front Crate]] and [[Lovely Crate]] are now guaranteed to appear in the [[Daily Store#Daily Crate Store|Daily Crate Store]].
**Their skins are also guaranteed to appear in the [[Daily Store#Daily Skin Store|Daily Skin Store]].
*Fixed VIP [[Gamepasses|gamepass]] cost being listed as {{Robux|350}} instead of {{Robux|400}} in the home section of the store.
*Fixed {{Color|Lovely|Valentines}} [[Sniper]] not having a placement sound.

:In '''v1.6.2a''':
*Fixed [[Elevators|elevator]] matches.
*Fixed mobile scaling issues.
*Fixed being able to open multiple crates at once.

